Package: geoareaweight
Type: Package
Title: Area Weights and Area-Weighted Means for Latitude-Longitude Grids
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Longhao", "Wang", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "hhuwlh@163.com")
Description: Correct area weights for latitude-longitude grids: cosine-latitude,
    exact spherical band areas and exact WGS84 (authalic latitude) cell areas.
    Provides NaN-aware area-weighted means, regional (masked) means, area
    integrals (totals) and area fractions for regular, irregular and Gaussian
    grids, keeping time and other dimensions.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/GISWLH/GeoAreaWeight
BugReports: https://github.com/GISWLH/GeoAreaWeight/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-US
Depends: R (>= 3.5)
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
